  "{name}, 2022–2026 total against one year's GDP: support for Ukraine {ua}; {ru} more paid to or earned from Russia; net {pct} ({eur}).": "{name}, total 2022–2026 frente al PIB de un año: apoyo a Ucrania {ua}; {ru} más pagado a Rusia o ganado con ella; saldo {pct} ({eur}).",
